{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213630","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213630","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1521363001:0":{"text":"...오셨군요.","source_cn":"……是你们啊。<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x494526644DE759E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521363002:0":{"text":"괜찮아요?","source_cn":"你还好吗？<key:dialog52>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42E10294DE0A9A0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521363003:0":{"text":"아뇨... 하나도 안 괜찮아요...","source_cn":"不……一点也不好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AF9F8443D396500","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521363004:0":{"text":"저... 사냥의 신의 기분을 알 것 같아요. 사랑하는 사람을 잃은 그 마음을...","source_cn":"我……我好像能理解狩猎神的感受了……失去爱人时的感受。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59404682015323FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521363005:0":{"text":"정말 힘들고... 고통스러워요. 마치 가슴 한쪽을 도려낸 것 같아요.","source_cn":"那真的很难受……很痛。就好像胸口被掏空了一块。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3DD81902E4DF1CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521363006:0":{"text":"마르코를 원망하지는 않아요. 그 선택이 틀린 건 아니니까요... 저희는 종족도 다르고, 전쟁도 있었고...","source_cn":"我不怪马尔科，他的选择没有错。只是……只是我们生来分属...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68F37A15BB94B7B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1521363006":{"text":"마르코를 원망하지는 않아요. 그 선택이 틀린 건 아니니까요... 저희는 종족도 다르고, 전쟁도 있었고...","source_cn":"我不怪马尔科，他的选择没有错。只是……只是我们生来分属不同的种族，又碰上了战争……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68F37A15BB94B7B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521363007:0":{"text":"네... 다들 그렇게 말하더라고요. 시간이 지나면 괜찮아지고, 마르코를 잊을 수 있을 거라고...","source_cn":"嗯……他们都说是那样。等过一段时间，我就会好起来，忘记...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4D81F996836191B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521363008:0":{"text":"그날이 빨리 왔으면 좋겠어요... 하지만 제가 정말로 마르코를 잊을 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"我希望那天能早点到来……但我又不觉得自己真的能忘了他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10F239C9DBBA027A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521363009:0":{"text":"걱정해 줘서 고마워요. 바보 같은 짓은 안 해요. 그냥 이 슬픔을 정리할 시간이 필요할 뿐이에요...","source_cn":"谢谢你们记挂着我，我不会做傻事的。我只是需要一点空间去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7764E6F1E285514B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"천천히 나아질 거야","source_cn":"会慢慢好起来的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5A2A7541E42D2F36","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"천천히 나아질 거야","female":"천천히 나아질 거야","variant_male_record_index":"78135","variant_female_record_index":"78136","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"시간이 치료해 줄 거야","source_cn":"时间会洗刷痛苦","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF3CBA297D9424DB9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"시간이 치료해 줄 거야","female":"시간이 치료해 줄 거야","variant_male_record_index":"78137","variant_female_record_index":"78138","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:芙":{"text":"푸","source":"芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"갈라","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}